+/* Mode 'g' (Phase 8 — Track B: on-chip LUT mask editor).
+ *
+ * Steps (per docs/plan.md §Phase 8):
+ *   1.  Read base.rbf from SD slot (TPU slot, h->tpu_lba) into SDRAM.
+ *   2.  Read edits.bin from SD slot (h->edits_lba) into SDRAM.
